{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55368","headline":"登落星湾水心寺题水轩（题拟） · 临川小吏","name":"登落星湾水心寺题水轩（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"分飞南渡春风晚，却返家林事业空。\n无限离情似杨柳，万条垂向水当中。\n（见《增修诗话总龟》卷三。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"临川小吏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55368.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55368","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}